    "recipesV83.JJ-E03-003.ingredient.4": "water",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E03-003.ingredient.5": "lemon (zest)",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E03-003.editorial.0": "Quesillo contains egg: use a food thermometer to check that the centre reaches at least 71°C. Cool promptly and refrigerate for the stated time; a set appearance does not replace a temperature check.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E03-003.editorial.1": "COMMERCIAL LABEL CHECK PENDING: verify composition, allergens and traces for the exact items selected once official shop prices and product references are available. Do not claim \"allergen-free\" or \"trace-free\" before product verification.",
