    "recipesV83.JJ-E03-007.editorial.2": "COMMERCIAL LABEL CHECK PENDING: verify composition, allergens and traces for the exact items selected once official shop prices and product references are available. Do not claim \"allergen-free\" or \"trace-free\" before product verification.",
