    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.title": "Chicken tikka masala with tomato and yogurt",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.allergen": "CONTAINS MILK: yogurt and cream. Refrigerate chicken while marinating (≤4 °C), avoid cross-contamination, and confirm 74 °C at the centre before serving. Rice is an optional extra.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABEL CHECK PENDING: once specific items, brands and official store prices are available, inspect full ingredients, declared allergens, possible traces and storage instructions on the package. Price does not certify allergen status.\n\nCOOKING TEST 61–70: the user confirms cooking and tasting this recipe and reports a satisfactory flavour. This confirmation does not include measured core temperatures, yield measurements, or food-safety testing.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.step.0": "Cut the chicken into large cubes and mix with the yogurt and half of the spices. Marinate in the refrigerator for 30 minutes.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.step.1": "Quickly brown the chicken in a hot pan with 15 ml of oil; remove it before it dries out.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.step.2": "In the same pan, cook the chopped onion in the remaining oil for 8 minutes; add the garlic and ginger.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.step.3": "Add the remaining spices and cook for 30 seconds, then add the crushed tomatoes. Simmer for 12 minutes to concentrate the sauce.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.step.4": "Return the chicken and its juices to the pan, add the cooking cream and simmer gently for 8–10 minutes until the chicken is fully cooked.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.step.5": "Adjust the salt and serve with cooked rice if you wish, recording the rice as an additional ingredient.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.ingredient.0": "chicken breast",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.ingredient.1": "plain natural yogurt",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.ingredient.2": "crushed tomato",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.ingredient.3": "cooking cream",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.ingredient.4": "onion",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.ingredient.5": "garlic",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-177.ingredient.6": "ginger",
