    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-279.title": "Thai green chicken and aubergine curry",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-279.allergen": "CONTAINS FISH: fish sauce; some brands may include crustaceans or traces. Avoid raw-chicken cross-contamination and verify at least 74 °C internally before serving.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABEL CHECK PENDING: once specific items, brands and official store prices are available, inspect full ingredients, declared allergens, possible traces and storage instructions on the package. Price does not certify allergen status.\n\nCOOKING TEST 61–70: the user confirms cooking and tasting this recipe and reports a satisfactory flavour. This confirmation does not include measured core temperatures, yield measurements, or food-safety testing.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-279.step.0": "Blend the green chilli, tender lemongrass, shallots, garlic, ginger, coriander stalks, cumin and ground coriander with one tablespoon of coconut milk.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-279.step.1": "Fry this paste in oil for 4 minutes until fragrant and slightly reduced.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-279.step.2": "Add the chicken pieces and stir for 3 minutes to coat them in the spices.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-279.step.3": "Pour in the coconut milk and gently simmer for 12 minutes.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-279.step.4": "Add the chopped aubergine and cook for another 10–12 minutes, until the chicken is fully cooked and the vegetables are tender.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E05-279.step.5": "Adjust the seasoning with fish sauce, sugar and lime juice; finish with basil and coriander leaves.",
