    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-068.title": "Patatas bravas with paprika sauce",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-068.allergen": "Wine vinegar may contain sulphites; check its label and the threshold applicable to the finished dish. Wash and cook the potatoes thoroughly.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABEL PENDING: when store-specific SKUs, brands, label photos or product sheets and official prices are available, verify composition, declared allergens, possible traces, pack sizes and storage. Price alone is not allergen evidence. Do not claim “trace-free”.",
