    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-068.step.1": "Dry the potatoes and toss with 35 ml of olive oil and half the salt.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-068.step.2": "Roast in a single layer for 25–30 minutes, turning once.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-068.step.3": "Sauté the onion and garlic in the remaining oil for 8–9 minutes.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-068.step.4": "Remove briefly from the heat and stir in the sweet and hot paprika without burning it.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-068.step.5": "Add the crushed tomatoes and water; simmer for twelve minutes, then blend smooth.",
