    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-169.title": "Indonesian sweet and spicy tempe orek",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-169.allergen": "CONTAINS SOY: tempeh and sauces. Kecap manis and soy sauce may contain WHEAT/GLUTEN; check both labels and cross-contact statements.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABEL PENDING: when store-specific SKUs, brands, label photos or product sheets and official prices are available, verify composition, declared allergens, possible traces, pack sizes and storage. Price alone is not allergen evidence. Do not claim “trace-free”.",
