    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-208.title": "Greek gemistá: stuffed tomatoes and peppers",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-208.allergen": "No Annex II allergens identified directly from the listed ingredients. Wash vegetables and make sure the filling rice is fully cooked. Cool and refrigerate leftovers promptly.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABEL PENDING: when store-specific SKUs, brands, label photos or product sheets and official prices are available, verify composition, declared allergens, possible traces, pack sizes and storage. Price alone is not allergen evidence. Do not claim “trace-free”.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-208.step.0": "Preheat the oven to 185 °C; cut lids from the tomatoes and peppers and hollow them out without breaking them.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-208.step.1": "Sauté the onion and garlic, then add the rice, tomato pulp and herbs; season with the listed salt and pepper.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-208.step.2": "Fill the vegetables to two-thirds of their capacity and replace the lids.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-208.step.3": "Arrange in a roasting dish with potato wedges, water and olive oil.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-208.step.4": "Bake covered for fifty minutes to cook the rice.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-208.step.5": "Uncover and brown for another 25–30 minutes, adding water if the dish dries out.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-208.step.6": "Check that the rice is tender and rest for ten minutes before serving.",
