    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-260.title": "Ginger beef with broccoli",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-260.allergen": "CONTAINS SOY and MOLLUSCS (oyster sauce; verify actual product composition). Soy and oyster sauces may contain WHEAT/GLUTEN. Cook beef thoroughly and prevent cross-contact.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABEL PENDING: when store-specific SKUs, brands, label photos or product sheets and official prices are available, verify composition, declared allergens, possible traces, pack sizes and storage. Price alone is not allergen evidence. Do not claim “trace-free”.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-260.step.0": "Slice the beef thinly against the grain and mix with one teaspoon of cornflour.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-260.step.1": "Blanch the broccoli for two minutes and drain thoroughly.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-260.step.2": "Mix the soy sauce, oyster sauce, sugar, remaining cornflour and water.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-260.step.3": "Stir-fry the beef in a hot wok using part of the listed vegetable oil in two batches; set aside.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-260.step.4": "Stir-fry the garlic, ginger and broccoli in the remaining oil for two minutes.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-260.step.5": "Return the beef and sauce mixture to the wok; boil for one or two minutes until thickened.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-260.step.6": "Add sliced spring onion and serve immediately.",
