    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-283.title": "Pad krapao moo: Thai pork and basil with rice",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-283.allergen": "CONTAINS EGG, FISH, MOLLUSCS (oyster sauce) AND SOY; sauces may contain WHEAT/GLUTEN. Cook minced pork to 71 °C internally; cook eggs fully or use pasteurised eggs if serving a runny yolk. Chill leftover rice promptly.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABEL PENDING: when store-specific SKUs, brands, label photos or product sheets and official prices are available, verify composition, declared allergens, possible traces, pack sizes and storage. Price alone is not allergen evidence. Do not claim “trace-free”.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-283.step.0": "Rinse and cook the jasmine rice covered with the listed water until tender; keep it warm.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-283.step.1": "Crush the garlic and chilli; mix the sauces and sugar in a cup.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-283.step.2": "Briefly fry the garlic and chilli in oil in a wok.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-283.step.3": "Add the minced pork and cook for 5–7 minutes, breaking up clumps, until fully cooked.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-283.step.4": "Pour in the sauces, reduce for two minutes and add the basil at the end.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-283.step.5": "Fry the eggs in a separate pan and cook them thoroughly if a runny yolk is not desired.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-283.step.6": "Serve the rice, pork and one egg per person, avoiding utensils contaminated by raw pork.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E06-283.ingredient.0": "minced pork",
