    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.title": "Indonesian coconut nasi uduk with egg and toppings",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.allergen": "CONTAINS EGG, PEANUTS and FISH (anchovies). Cook eggs thoroughly, heat anchovies well and keep utensils separate to prevent cross-contact. Serve freshly cooked rice; cool and refrigerate leftovers promptly.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABEL CHECK PENDING: once exact products, SKUs and official store prices are available, check brand, composition, allergens, possible traces, batch and storage. A price does not establish allergen safety.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.step.0": "Rinse the rice until the water runs almost clear. Lightly bruise the lemongrass to release its aroma.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.step.1": "Put the rice, coconut milk, water, salt, lemongrass and lime leaves in a covered pot. Bring to a gentle simmer, reduce the heat to its lowest setting and cook for about 16–18 minutes without stirring.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.step.2": "Turn off the heat and let the rice rest covered for 10 minutes. Remove the lemongrass and leaves; fluff gently with a fork.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.step.3": "Boil the eggs for 10 minutes from the start of boiling, then cool and peel. Wash and slice the cucumber.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.step.4": "Chop the shallots and fry slowly in 20 ml of oil until crisp. Drain on paper towels.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.step.5": "Toast the dried anchovies in a pan with 5 ml of oil until crisp and piping hot. Keep the fish separate from other foods.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.step.6": "Blend the tomato, garlic and chilli. Cook this paste for 6–8 minutes in the remaining 10 ml of oil until it no longer tastes raw: this makes a simple sambal without shrimp paste.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.step.7": "Serve the rice with the egg, anchovies, peanuts, cucumber, shallots and a little sambal, respecting the listed quantities.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.ingredient.0": "long-grain white rice",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.ingredient.1": "coconut milk",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E07-162.ingredient.2": "water",
