    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-117.editorial.0": "CONTAINS MOLLUSCS (mussels) and MILK (butter). Check wine for possible SULPHITES. Buy mussels from an approved source, keep chilled, discard broken shells and those that do not close before cooking, and any that stay closed afterward. Serve immediately.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-117.editorial.1": "COMMERCIAL LABEL CHECK PENDING: verify brand, SKU, ingredients, allergens, traces, batch and storage once exact products and official store prices are available. Price does not validate a label.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.title": "Yucatán lime soup with chicken and crispy tortillas",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.allergen": "Cook CHICKEN to 74 °C in the centre and prevent cross-contamination. Tortillas labelled 100% corn may still have traces or other ingredients depending on the manufacturer; check the label. Refrigerate leftover soup promptly.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABEL CHECK PENDING: once exact products, SKUs and official store prices are available, check brand, composition, allergens, possible traces, batch and storage. A price does not establish allergen safety.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.step.0": "Put the chicken, 100 g onion, half the garlic, a pinch of salt and 1,650 ml water in a pot. Bring to a gentle boil, skim the foam and cook for 25 minutes or until the chicken is thoroughly cooked.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.step.1": "Remove the chicken, let cool slightly for a few minutes and shred with two forks. Strain the stock and retain 1,200–1,400 ml for the soup.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.step.2": "Dice the tomato, pepper and remaining 60 g onion. Chop the remaining garlic.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.step.3": "Heat 15 ml oil and sauté onion, pepper and tomato for 8–10 minutes. Add garlic and spices during the last minute.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.step.4": "Add the strained stock and simmer for 8 minutes. Add the shredded chicken and keep hot without boiling vigorously. Adjust seasoning using the remaining measured salt without exceeding the listed amount.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.step.5": "Slice the corn tortillas into strips; fry in batches with 30 ml oil in a frying pan and drain on paper towels.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.step.6": "Turn off the heat and gradually add the fresh juice of 2 limes, tasting the acidity. Serve with crisp tortilla strips, coriander, slices of the third lime and optional chilli. Avoid boiling lime juice for long to prevent bitterness.",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.ingredient.0": "boneless chicken thighs",
    "recipesV83.JJ-E08-244.ingredient.1": "water for stock",
