    "recipesV83.JJ-R002.allergen": "Commercial vegetable stock may contain CELERY, GLUTEN, SOY or MILK depending on its recipe: check the label before making allergen claims. Blend hot soup carefully to avoid splashes; cool and refrigerate promptly if storing.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABELS PENDING: once the brand, SKU, product and official price for each store and store format are available, check ingredients, allergens and possible traces on the actual label. Price does not certify allergens.",
