    "recipesV83.JJ-R003.allergen": "CONTAINS MILK (YOGURT). Pure corn gofio is maize-based, but check ingredients and possible gluten cross-contact during milling. Keep yogurt chilled; do not give honey to babies under 12 months.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABELS PENDING: once the brand, SKU, product and official price for each store and store format are available, check ingredients, allergens and possible traces on the actual label. Price does not certify allergens.",
