    "recipesV83.JJ-R006.title": "Spanish potato and onion omelette for two",
    "recipesV83.JJ-R006.allergen": "CONTAINS EGG. A runny omelette poses greater risk, especially for pregnant people, children, older adults and immunocompromised people; cook it until completely set for these diners. Prevent raw-egg cross-contamination.\n\nCOMMERCIAL LABELS PENDING: once the brand, SKU, product and official price for each store and store format are available, check ingredients, allergens and possible traces on the actual label. Price does not certify allergens.",
